.pytest_cache/
Data/
dev/
output/
BSTPP.egg*/
dist/
# setuptools' other output dir, the sibling of dist/ that was never listed.
/build/
**/*.pkl
# ...but the trained VAE decoders shipped with the package must be tracked
# (bstpp/main.py loads them at model construction, e.g. 2d_decoder_15_5_large.pkl).
!bstpp/decoders/*.pkl
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
html/
doc_temp/
VAE_Training.ipynb
Notes.txt
# Machine-local golden-pin scratch dropped at the repo root by ad-hoc
# pin_check_v2.py runs. Root-anchored on purpose: the DECLARED baselines
# refactor-patches/baselines-2026-07/pins.json and
# refactor-patches/baselines-2026-08-polygon/pins.json are tracked and gate
# the corpus-identity check, so they must not match this pattern.
/pins*.json
